==Battleground==
*5 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**25 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
**15 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Having [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] basically means you win the stage. Additionally, a group of [[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cats]] is able to stall the Wild Doges to a halt. However, if you don't have those units, use high DPS AOE attackers such as [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] for the Wild Doges and anti-red attackers such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] for the Casaurian Ahirujo. Use Research [[Cat Combo]]s to better spam midranged attackers. The high volume of Wild Doges gives you enough cash so that you can make good use of the combo. Once all the peons die, The Face is practically powerless.

